# Build context for both images. Excludes only what a build cannot use.
#
# It previously excluded main.go, cli/, benchmark/, llm/, config/, chart/ and
# tools/, which was right when the router was its own small binary under
# router/cmd/ needing only router/ and kvcache/. The router is now `wekai router
# serve` — the whole wekai binary, built from the ROOT package — so excluding
# those left the build with no Go files in the context at all.
#
# vendor/ stays out on size grounds: 80+ MB, and both images build against the
# module cache via `go mod download`.
vendor

# Not inputs to a build.
.git
.github
.dagger
.idea
docs
*.md

# Build outputs, which would otherwise be copied in over a fresh build.
dist
/wekai
/wekai-core
/bin
results
*.log
*.out
